      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Belljamin Button]",
      "translation" : "[贝尔杰明·巴顿]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm not sure how you'll keep track of time in there but be as careful as you can.",
      "translation" : "我不确定你在里面该如何判断时间，但无论如何都要小心。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Belljamin Button]",
      "translation" : "[贝尔杰明·巴顿]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am here all day for the safety of adventurers. I always alert them about the danger. That's why I need some form of payment.",
      "translation" : "我整天都在这里保护冒险者，也总是提醒他们那里很危险。所以我需要收取一些费用。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Belljamin Button]",
      "translation" : "[贝尔杰明·巴顿]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Phew...You've made a good choice. This place is brutal so you should probably get back to a safe area.",
      "translation" : "呼...你做了正确的选择。那里非常残酷，最好回到安全的地方。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Belljamin Button]",
      "translation" : "[贝尔杰明·巴顿]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Perhaps you've seen me before?",
      "translation" : "你以前也许见过我？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Belljamin Button]",
      "translation" : "[贝尔杰明·巴顿]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You saw me in a different place, with a different look.",
      "translation" : "你在别的地方见过我，当时我的模样不同。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Who are you?",
      "translation" : "你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Get me out of here!",
      "translation" : "带我离开这里！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Belljamin Button]",
      "translation" : "[贝尔杰明·巴顿]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Belljamin Button",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you explain to me what you've seen, what you've done?",
      "translation" : "你能告诉我你看到了什么、做了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
